{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方最大号白紫色主标题首先吸引视线，尤其是紫色强调的“舍不得被当作自己人的日子”和“连那些气也肯再受”；随后下方同样醒目的大字“心慌”容易吸引注意。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他似乎想回到一段曾经被接纳、但也受过委屈的关系或环境，具体为什么想回去不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"心慌、害怕、不敢继续想。\",\n  \"missed\": \"究竟是舍不得曾经被当作自己人的感觉，还是害怕孤单到愿意再次忍受委屈；中间小字描述的声音变化、重新看见过去的自己，以及最初的问题再次浮现。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"主标题单块较长，包含想回去的两种不同动机，需要读完整句才能辨清。\",\n    \"上下两处大字都比较显眼，处境和情绪分散在两块中，需要结合才能理解因果关系。\",\n    \"中间小字连续堆叠多行，包含多层叙述，快速扫视时不容易提取有效信息。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5f84651c-6d88-46bc-bdce-bb0ff43f3b78", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T023239896662Z", "elapsed_seconds": 32.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:33:12.693029+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "71f6a947503ee6d237c79d8631186cab5ef49343739f0b0f94ef3dbfce5cfa39", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f9